  "rule": "best = lowest median; resolved iff runner-up median - best median > max(IQR of the two) (#60's test); within_spread = every n_batches whose median exceeds best's by at most max(IQR of best, IQR of it).",
  "protocol": "test/test_kernel_device.py's opt-in wall-clock sweep: host steady_clock over a cell's whole batched launch sequence into one zeroed J, then one synchronize; 5 warm-up + 31 timed sequences per input; n_bra x n_ket = 2048 x 128, no screening; the timed binary is the one checked against reference/ first.",
